{"id":"n67844-2-3","stage":1,"title":"옳다 · 不如","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67844-2-3-1","ko":"이럴 줄 알았으면 대학원에 가는 게 옳았어.","zh":"早知道会这样，当初去读研究生才是对的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이럴","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄","meaning":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","explanation":"줄：表示某个方法或实际内容等。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알았으면","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대학원에","meaning":"研究生院","explanation":"대학원：研究生院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"대학원","audio":"/audio/9986b156ac970834ed38.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66290","senseId":"1","lemma":"대학원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옳았어.","meaning":"不如","explanation":"옳다：不如；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"옳다","audio":"/audio/09251e6f0b51e75f4ba8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67844","senseId":"2","lemma":"옳다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"以为","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于某个事实，认为或觉得如此。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"9986b156ac970834","term":"대학원","zh":"研究生院","audio":"/audio/9986b156ac970834ed38.mp3","entryId":"66290","definition":"大学毕业的人接受专业教育、进行研究的机构。","pronunciation":["대ː하권"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"09251e6f0b51e75f","term":"옳다","zh":"不如","audio":"/audio/09251e6f0b51e75f4ba8.mp3","entryId":"67844","definition":"反而更好。","pronunciation":["올타"]}],"audio":"/audio/6f72155d8f7781f92317.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67844-2-3-2","ko":"왜? 회사 일이 재미있다고 했었잖아.","zh":"为什么？你不是说公司的工作很有趣吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜?","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재미있다고","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했었잖아.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9e24d585bb2b72e69b2c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67844","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":59,"sequenceScore":2.8767,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["早知道会这样，当初去读研究生才是对的。","为什么？你不是说公司的工作很有趣吗？","每次过节都是你在照顾所有的亲戚弟弟妹妹吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["早知道会这样，当初去读研究生才是对的。","为什么？你不是说公司的工作很有趣吗？","每次过节都是你在照顾所有的亲戚弟弟妹妹吗？"],"answer":1}]}
